<%= @updated ? "#{@rsvp.name} changed their RSVP" : "#{@rsvp.name} just RSVP'd" %> for <%= @event.name %>.

Coming: <%= @rsvp.attending? ? "Yes" : "No" %>
<% if @rsvp.attending? -%>
Extra guests: <%= @rsvp.guests_count %> (party of <%= @rsvp.party_size %>)
<% end -%>
Phone: <%= @rsvp.formatted_phone %>
<% if @rsvp.note.present? -%>
Note: <%= @rsvp.note %>
<% end -%>

Headcount so far: <%= @event.headcount %> (<%= @event.attending_rsvps.count %> yes, <%= @event.rsvps.where(attending: false).count %> no)

Invite: https://eitan.duckdns.org/<%= @event.slug %>
Guest list: https://eitan.duckdns.org/admin
